# Git LFS - added 24 Aug 2026
#
# SCOPED TO system/models/ ON PURPOSE. A broad pattern such as `*.pt` would
# sweep any teammate's future weights into LFS as well, and LFS storage and
# bandwidth are billed to the REPOSITORY OWNER, not to whoever pushes. Only
# the files this system actually loads are tracked here.
#
# Anyone cloning must run `git lfs install` once before cloning, or these
# files arrive as 130-byte pointer text and the pipeline fails in a way that
# looks like a corrupted model.
system/models/**/*.safetensors filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
system/models/**/*.pt          filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
system/models/**/*.bin         filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
